# data file for fldtk fluid (Fast Light User Interface Designer)
version 1.0000
comment {Assign the fldtk Fluid editor's own icon at runtime.

Ported from FLTK's fluid/fluid_icon.fl. FLTK embeds fluid-128.png; the
icon here is the SVG flask of fluid.flask_logo, rasterized at each size
a desktop asks for, so it is sharp at every one of them.
}
  {
    in_source
    in_header
  }
Function {makeFluidIcon(Window win)}
  {
  }
  {
    code {import fluid.flask_logo : flaskIcons;
win.icons(flaskIcons());}
      {
      }
  }
